rName":"フリーナ","textMapHash":1374343922,"text":"お砂糖たっぷり！","nextNodeIds":[401970126]},{"nodeId":401970126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30770,"speakerName":"レピーヌ・ポーリーン","textMapHash":1084576858,"text":"お砂糖たっぷり！","nextNodeIds":[401970127]},{"nodeId":401970127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30770,"speakerName":"レピーヌ・ポーリーン","textMapHash":66751842,"text":"…って、何に入れるんです？","nextNodeIds":[401970128]},{"nodeId":401970128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1075,"speakerName":"ナヴィア","textMapHash":454997642,"text":"レピーヌ・ポーリーン、来たのね！「あれ」はできた？","nextNodeIds":[401970129]},{"nodeId":401970129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30770,"speakerName":"レピーヌ・ポーリーン","textMapHash":4102518026,"text":"もちろんです。とても順調でしたよ！","nextNodeIds":[401970130]},{"nodeId":401970130,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":950624010,"text":"えっ？なにか重要な任務でもやってたのか？","nextNodeIds":[401970131]},{"nodeId":401970131,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30770,"speakerName":"レピーヌ・ポーリーン","textMapHash":4278135066,"text":"さあ、どうぞお受け取りください！","nextNodeIds":[401970132]},{"nodeId":401970132,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":564934690,"text":"これって…","nextNodeIds":[401970133]},{"nodeId":401970133,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3807920874,"text":"わあ、すごい！イベントのパノラマ地図だ。みんなの絵も描いてあるぞ！","nextNodeIds":[401970134]},{"nodeId":401970134,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1075,"speakerName":"ナヴィア","textMapHash":3133085906,"text":"ふふっ、映影ランドの大成功を祝って、何か特別な記念品を作りたいって話し合ってたの。","nextNodeIds":[401970135]},{"nodeId":401970135,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1075,"speakerName":"ナヴィア","textMapHash":2774699506,"text":"この映影ランドはみんなが力を合わせて一から作り上げたものだからね。みんなで一緒に描いた、この地図みたいに。","nextNodeIds":[401970136]},{"nodeId":401970136,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30824,"speakerName":"エスコフィエ","textMapHash":2805821578,"text":"ほとんどは絵の得意なレピーヌ・ポーリーンさんに描いてもらったけど、他のみんなにもできるだけ描き加えてもらったのよ。","nextNodeId